  "text_input": "Patient was at his usual state of health till evening, then he developed complaints of abdominal pain which was insidious in onset and gradually progressive in nature, colicky pain, aggravated on having food.\nAlso had complaints of vomiting around 10 episodes containing food particles, non-blood tinged, non-bilious since evening.\nHe also had complaints of loose stools since evening around 10 episodes, watery in consistency, non-mucoid, non-blood tinged, but after that patient presented to casualty, he passed blood-stained stool (1 time).\nAlso has complaints of generalized weakness since evening.\nHistory of outside food consumption last night (fried rice).\nHistory of trauma to left little finger × 16 years\nNo history of fever, chills, chest pain, breathlessness, cough\nNo history of palpitations, PND, orthopnea\nNo history of burning micturition, hematuria, decreased urine output\nNo history of blood transfusion in past",
